<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5345] After deleting the user from ldap, the project permission interface reports an error</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5345</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reproduction steps.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. create a user from ldap&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2. give the user project privileges.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3. delete the user from ldap&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4. Expected: the current user is not in the project permission page, actual: there is this user on the project permission page, click details will prompt an error 500 and show that &lt;b&gt;the user does not exist&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explain, here is not the problem of synchronization, after deleting the user hours or this error&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
